---
interface Props { dataVersion?: string; inventoryTs?: string }
const { dataVersion = '—', inventoryTs = '—' } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class="app-footer" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="wrap footer-grid">
    <div style="display:grid;gap:6px">
      <p><b>数据底座</b>红豆广告媒体管理系统 2027 实时可售库存 · 新云大数据平台 2023-05 轨迹与 POI 补充</p>
      <p><b>口径声明</b>曝光、Reach、Frequency 与 CPM 为确定性模型估算，非实测触达；不承诺入园人数或财务回报。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-meta">
      <span>版本 <span data-meta-version>{dataVersion}</span></span>
      <span>快照 <span data-meta-ts>{inventoryTs}</span></span>
      <span>FLAIR MEDIA · 上海新云传媒</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
